<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>VNC on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/categories/vnc/</link><description>Recent content in VNC on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-tw</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 20 Oct 2021 16:14:47 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/categories/vnc/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>【筆記】在GCP上建立可Remote dekstop的Ubuntu環境</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2021/20211020-gcp-remote-desktop/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 Oct 2021 16:14:47 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2021/20211020-gcp-remote-desktop/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://medium.com/@huiqinng/%E7%AD%86%E8%A8%98-%E5%9C%A8gcp%E4%B8%8A%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E5%8F%AFremote-dekstop%E7%9A%84ubuntu%E7%92%B0%E5%A2%83-e56fdbd3a4f2" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;【筆記】在 GCP 上建立可 Remote dekstop 的 Ubuntu 環境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id="install"&gt;install&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-a8af305996f28f54c222c052eccbdbbf-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# dependency&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo apt-get install ubuntu-desktop gnome-panel gnome-settings-daemon metacity nautilus gnome-terminal
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# VNC Server&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo apt-get install vnc4server
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# 安裝完成後先執行vncserver，會先跳出password設定的選項&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;vncserver
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"# dependency\nsudo apt-get install ubuntu-desktop gnome-panel gnome-settings-daemon metacity nautilus gnome-terminal\n\n# VNC Server\nsudo apt-get install vnc4server\n\n# 安裝完成後先執行vncserver，會先跳出password設定的選項\nvncserver\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 id="modify-vncxstartup"&gt;modify &lt;code&gt;~/.vnc/xstartup&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-a8af305996f28f54c222c052eccbdbbf-1"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="cp"&gt;#!/bin/sh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Uncomment the following two lines for normal desktop:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# unset SESSION_MANAGER&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# exec /etc/X11/xinit/xinitrc&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt; -x /etc/vnc/xstartup &lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;exec&lt;/span&gt; /etc/vnc/xstartup
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt; -r &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$HOME&lt;/span&gt;/.Xresources &lt;span class="o"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; xrdb &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$HOME&lt;/span&gt;/.Xresources
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;xsetroot -solid grey
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;vncconfig -iconic &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;x-terminal-emulator -geometry 80x24+10+10 -ls -title &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$VNCDESKTOP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt; Desktop&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;x-window-manager &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;gnome-panel &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;gnome-settings-daemon &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;metacity &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;nautilus &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"#!/bin/sh\n\n# Uncomment the following two lines for normal desktop:\n# unset SESSION_MANAGER\n# exec /etc/X11/xinit/xinitrc\n\n[ -x /etc/vnc/xstartup ] \u0026\u0026 exec /etc/vnc/xstartup\n[ -r $HOME/.Xresources ] \u0026\u0026 xrdb $HOME/.Xresources\nxsetroot -solid grey\nvncconfig -iconic \u0026\nx-terminal-emulator -geometry 80x24+10+10 -ls -title \"$VNCDESKTOP Desktop\" \u0026\nx-window-manager \u0026\n\ngnome-panel \u0026\ngnome-settings-daemon \u0026\nmetacity \u0026\nnautilus \u0026\n","title":"shell"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 id="exec"&gt;exec&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-a8af305996f28f54c222c052eccbdbbf-2"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# 殺掉目前執行的vncserver 然後重新執行&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;vncserver -kill :1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# vncserver預設是執行在port 5900上，如果在後面加上：1 就是5901以此類推&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;vncserver :1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"# 殺掉目前執行的vncserver 然後重新執行\nvncserver -kill :1\n# vncserver預設是執行在port 5900上，如果在後面加上：1 就是5901以此類推\nvncserver :1\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 id="設定-reboot-的時候自動執行-vncserver"&gt;設定 reboot 的時候自動執行 vncserver&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-a8af305996f28f54c222c052eccbdbbf-3"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;@reboot /usr/bin/vncserver :1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"@reboot /usr/bin/vncserver :1\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>